# w9_102_20_10_g51_1_2859 (28592a7536416da4), circuit bare8: bare, equivariant, sequential; d_circ = 8.
# X-basis memory (data prepared and read out in the X basis, X-type logical
# observables, detectors of the X checks only), 10 rounds; qubits in the database
# convention: qubit j < 51 = left block, element j of GAP Elements(G); 51 + j = right block;
# ancilla of X-check i = 102 + i, of Z-check i = 153 + i (check i = row i of H_X / H_Z
# as rebuilt by scripts/codes.py).  Observables: k = 20 independent logicals.
